{"ref":"BDB, פָּלִיט","hw":"פָּלִיט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פָּלִיט</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Amos 9:1\" href=\"/Amos.9.1\">Am 9:1</a></sup> <strong>escaped one, fugitive</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.15\">2 K 9:15</a> +; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלִיטֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:4\" href=\"/Judges.12.4\">Ju 12:4</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלְיטָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:14\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.14\">Ob 14</a>, etc.;—<a data-ref=\"Amos 9:1\" href=\"/Amos.9.1\">Am 9:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.15\">2 K 9:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:13\" href=\"/Genesis.14.13\">Gn 14:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.26\">Ez 24:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.21\">33:21</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> loc.), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.22\">22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרִיד וּפ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:22\" href=\"/Joshua.8.22\">Jos 8:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.17\">Je 42:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ וְשָׂרִיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 44:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.44.14\">44:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.22\">La 2:22</a>; c. genit. subj. <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:5\" href=\"/Judges.12.5\">Ju 12:5</a> <em>fugitives of</em> Ephr. (del. in v <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:4\" href=\"/Judges.12.4\">4</a>, see GFM), so c. sf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.9\">Ez 6:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.16\">7:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:14\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.14\">Ob 14</a>; c. genit. obj., <em>escaped of</em>, i.e. <em>from</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.20\">Is 45:20</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלִיטֵי חֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 44:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.44.28\">Je 44:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.8\">Ez 6:8</a>.","next":"BDB, פָּלֵיט","prev":"BDB, פַּלֵט"}